{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19708","headline":"衡州岁前游合江亭见山樱蕊未折因赋含彩恡惊春 · 吕温","name":"衡州岁前游合江亭见山樱蕊未折因赋含彩恡惊春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"山樱先春发，红蕊满霜枝。\n幽处竟谁见，芳心空自知。\n似夺朝日照，疑畏煖风吹。\n欲问含彩意，恐惊轻薄儿。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕温","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_19708.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_19708","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}